I recommend using libpng version 0.96, the latest.  You're not supposed to
compile it separately though; rather, you're to unpack it in the
ghostscript source directory and ghostscript's makefile will compile it
for you.  (If you unpacked it somewhere else then just move the libpng
directory into ghostscript's source directory.)  The only place you should
issue a 'make' is in ghostscript's source directory, not in any
subdirectories within it.

I just recently compiled this, so if you need anymore help just post it.

