> getpwnam to use a file other than /etc/passwd.    Works fine under OSF 2.1
> through 3.2d, but has no effect under DU 4.0a.  Any ideas?

There is a bug in the 4.0[ab] version of setpwfile.  I receive the
following answer when I asked about it:

>     There is an easy workaround to the problem.  A direct quote from the
>     developer:
>        Simply add a call to endpwent() before the setpwfile() call.
>        That sets the initial state in the library which is missing if
>        the first getpw*-related call is setpwfile().

Adding the endpwent() call seemed to fix the problems I was seeing.
